}}'''Clay''' was a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[Chroma Box]]. Clay was soon deleted from the game after [[Nikilis]] redesigned the [[Chroma Box]] into the [[Rainbow Box]].

==Appearance==
Its blade is clay brown, hence the name. The guard is white, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*Its original design was [[Pepper]].
*This, along with the other knives from the [[Chroma Box]], was removed from all players’ [[Inventory|inventories]].
